Having a repair service alongside retail sales means customers with an existing generator, compressor or lawnmower needing maintenance can use the same business that sold similar equipment, rather than searching separately for a repair specialist. This combination suits both homeowners maintaining garden equipment and contractors relying on compaction equipment and generators for site work. The Hennopspark store is open Monday to Friday from 7:30am to 4:30pm, serving Centurion-area customers needing to buy, service or repair power tools and construction equipment.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.passionatetools.co.za/', '$[#]', 'https://passionatetools.co.za/?page_id=52'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'passionate-tools-hennopspark' AND description = 'Passionate Tools has operated as a retail and service centre for power tools, hand tools and construction equipment in Hennopspark since 2008, supplying and repairing items such as generators, compressors, lawnmowers, chainsaws and compaction equipment.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
-- pentacon-civils-lyttelton (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Pentacon Civils has operated in the construction industry since 1998, completing more than 760 projects from its Lyttelton base in Centurion. The company specialises in civil works including site clearance, demolitions and bulk earthworks, roads and layer works, paving contracts, and rock crushing, alongside parking areas for industrial and commercial developments.

Its project list includes work on the Woolworths distribution centre in Midrand, the BMW plant in Rosslyn, Sandton Gate Phase 2, and the Eyethu Mall in Soweto, giving the company a track record across major retail, logistics and automotive sites rather than only smaller local jobs. Pentacon also offers low-bed moves for transporting heavy plant and equipment between sites. Developers and contractors across Gauteng needing earthworks, demolitions, roads or paving on an industrial or commercial project can draw on more than 25 years of civil construction experience.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.pentacon.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'pentacon-civils-lyttelton' AND description = 'Pentacon Civils has operated in the construction industry since 1998, specialising in civil works such as road construction, bulk earthworks, demolitions and industrial and commercial building projects, with more than 760 completed projects to date.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
