A typical recommended system includes an 8kW hybrid inverter, a 10kWh lithium battery and 10 to 12 solar panels, guide-priced from around R110,000 installed including the certificate of compliance for the solar component. For homes in golf estates and similar developments with strict aesthetic rules, PFB also offers panel netting designed to keep solar installations compliant with estate requirements. Homeowners and businesses across Pretoria East and Gauteng wanting solar power, backup water supply or integrated smart security can start with a free site assessment from PFB Energy Group.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://pfbenergy.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'pfb-energy-group-wingate-park' AND description = 'PFB Energy Group designs hybrid solar and battery storage systems for homes and businesses, and also offers CCTV installation with AI-enhanced detection and water tank, pressure pump and filtration systems, following a professional site assessment.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
